 new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, a AAA level is highly recommended for mobile devices because of screen size and luminosity issues; this means a 7:1 ratio for text."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations":{"abstract":[{"text":"Contains a set of helpers and extensions shared for higher level targets.","type":"text"}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_layers.png"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations","role":"collection","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Foundations"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","title":"Foundations"},"ic_layers.png":{"alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSFoundations\/ic_layers.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier"